# Server-side RPC for Vite `/rpc` (dev) and Vercel `/api/rpc` (prod).
# Never commit `.env`. Never put the key in `VITE_RPC_URL` (it ships in the page).
#
# Quote so `?api-key=` is not stripped:
# RPC_URL="https://mainnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=YOUR_KEY"
#
# Vercel: set RPC_URL on the project for Production and Preview (same name, no VITE_ prefix).
